    "summary": "This guide is for students walking the stage and wh\u0101nau celebrating with them. Watch the video to learn about arrival, seating, the ceremony process, and the highlights that make the day special.\n\nThe ceremony includes certificate and diploma recognition, Bachelor\u2019s capping with the trencher, cultural celebrations like haka and waiata, and memorable wh\u0101nau cheering. Accessibility support is available at all our venues, with ushers ready to assist.\n\nCelebrate, capture memories, and bring the joy. We can\u2019t wait to see you.",
